# Server-side NetEase login, independent of each player's personal login.
# Paste your complete request Cookie header or MUSIC_U=value on the next line.
# Leave blank for anonymous playback. Do not include quotes around the full header.
# A nonempty value here takes priority over an AllMusic-format cookie.json.
# Changes take effect on the next song lookup; no server restart is needed.
# Keep this file private. Never distribute it with the plugin or client.
